	keywords = {Bus transportation; Charging stations; Constrained optimization; Constraint satisfaction problems; Depreciation; Dynamic programming; Electric bikes; Electric load distribution; Flow batteries; Health risks; HVDC power transmission; Hybrid vehicles; Integer programming; Light electric vehicles; Linear programming; Mass transportation; Maximum likelihood estimation; Microgrids; Multiobjective optimization; Nonlinear programming; Occupational risks; Overhead lines; Pareto principle; Passive solar; Power distribution networks; Power distribution planning; Public risks; Risk analysis; Solar fuels; Stochastic models; Stochastic programming; Structural optimization; Urban transportation; Vehicle-to-grid; Chance constraint; Charging station; Coordinated expansion planning; Expansion planning; Personal light electric vehicle; Power distribution network; Robust modeling; Urban charging station; Stochastic systems; algorithm; alternative energy; electric vehicle; greenhouse gas; heuristics; public transport; transportation system; urban transport},
